    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***UNDER OFFER***\r\n\r\nNestled in the heart of Lisselton village, this charming detached two bedroom cottage offers an exceptional opportunity for discerning buyers seeking immense potential. The property extends to approximately 60 sq.m, featuring a functional layout that comprises an entrance hallway, a cozy sitting room, two bedrooms, kitchen, utility room, bathroom and separate toilet, complemented by a highly practical attached store. \r\n\r\nVacant for over two years, this dwelling represents an ideal project for those wishing to create a bespoke countryside retreat, with the added advantage that buyers may qualify for significant refurbishment grant assistance. The cottage stands on a sprawling, mature site of approximately 0.72 hectares (1.77 acres) under Folio KY1345, beautifully framed by a tree-lined boundary that ensures excellent privacy. \r\n\r\nSuperbly located, the property is within a convenient 15 minute drive of both the bustling heritage town of Listowel and the famous Ballybunion seaside resort, renowned for its stunning beaches and world-class golf club. Serviced by mains water, electricity and its original on-site septic tank, this property is a rare find in today's market. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly advised to fully appreciate the outstanding scope and idyllic setting on offer. Call 068 21739 today to arrange your appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 2.6m x 1.2m \r\nWith Stira attic hatch.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 3.4m x 2.4m \r\nWith solid fuel open fireplace.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.0m x 3.5m \r\nBuilt-in wardrobe. \r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.6m x 4.6m \r\nOil fired Stanley range and hot-press.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 3.1m \r\n\r\n\r\nRear Entrance Hall/Utility - 1.1m x 3.0m \r\nRear entrance hall/utility with sink.\r\n\r\nToilet - 1.6m x 1.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.0m x 1.5m \r\nWith sink and bath.\r\n\r\nAttached Lean-to Store - 4.6m x 2.4m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Mass concrete construction with pitched slate roof and block built flat roof extension.\r\nElectricity connected.\r\nLarge site.\r\nDouble glazed aluminum and PVC windows.\r\nMains water. \r\nOnsite septic tank.\r\nImmediate proximity to Primary School & all Secondary School bus routes."
      },
